price reaches a solid balance between maintaining that accessibility, and still meeting the studios goals and needs to keep things moving forward. That being said, we do plan to raise the price once we get into our full release, so definitely consider getting ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:01:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034407","verified_at":"2026-10-23T01:15:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1847286114031095","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Breaking Death's Curse: Everlast Demo with the Devs","summary":"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:52:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031095","verified_at":"2026-10-22T09:06:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1847286114027471","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Game is Launching into Early Access Oct 28th!","summary":"The Big Day is Nearly Here!Everlast: Undying Tale Launches into Early Access Wednesday, October 28th 2026!We've been hard at work over the last three years getting our dream project ready for the world. They say never start with your dream game, but we didn't listen! Everlast: Undying Tale is an MMO-Lite Action RPG where humanity is first getting it's footholds on a land under constant attack from the undead. Explore, loot, craft, fight bosses, share in party based quests or play solo, and progr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:06:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027471","verified_at":"2026-10-21T11:31:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1846651706691673","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is Starting, Here's Everything New!","summary":"Next Fest is Starting, Here's Everything New!We've got the finishing touches on our latest update ready just in time for the launch of Next Fest, while some of these were covered in our pre-launch tester update, the vast majority of changes will be covered here and will be new to any players who haven't hopped in since our last big update. Here's a fairly comprehensive list of all of our fixes and changes up to this point.Be sure to follow the links on our steam page to join our discord and foll","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:15:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691673","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1846651706690955","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Servers are going down in preparation for our latest demo!","summary":"Our servers for the public demo will be down for update and last minute maintenance ahead of Next Fest! Servers will resume at 10am PST. This is coming on the heels of a new update. We'll share more about that update as it drops today so be sure to keep an eye out for that!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:02:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690955","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1846651706687810","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Last Minute Changes and Polish Ahead of Next Fest","summary":"Last Minute Changes and Polish Ahead of Next FestThis update includes hotfixes, Qol, top requests, balancing and combat, and some last minute polish and UI changes as we get ready for steam's next fest event starting tomorrow! Please follow us on discord to keep up with the latest, chat with devs, and talk with the community. As we head into next fest, any feedback and bug reporting about the game on top of what we have already is greatly appreciated (More than you might ever know or think haha)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T19:17:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687810","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1846018067930120","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"update","title":"NextFest Demo Update is Here!","summary":"NextFest Demo Update is Here!Our latest update focuses on bringing the majority of previously unfinished systems and features into the game. This includes a huge laundry list of new and improved features with so many changes it was actually quite difficult to choose what all to include here! For an even deeper look into all of these changes as well as our continuing plans for the future, join our Discord: https://discord.gg/wMrdng3rFz or follow us on social media. New Features Trading: Everlast ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T15:18:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1846018067929720","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Servers are going down in preparation for our latest demo!","summary":"From 9:45a - 12:00p ET our servers for our public demo will be down for update maintenance! This is coming on the heels of a massive new update. We'll share more about that update as it drops today so be sure to keep an eye out for that!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:37:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929720","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1843481262701843","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"update","title":"Updated Demo Hotfix","summary":"Updated Demo Hotfix We Have a small hotfix following yesterday's new and updated free demo release. This hotfix resolves some of the most immediate issues players may have encountered on their playthrough of the demo. We greatly appreciate players support, patience, and any feedback offered in our discord Hotfix NotesFixed Copper Deposits not spawning correctlyAudio Level AdjustmentsFixed Willow recipes glitch at the Survival TableAdded tooltip for level requirements on higher quality gearFixed ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T14:29:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262701843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1843481262699926","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Extended Free Demo Now Playable","summary":"Updated Demo Now Available!Update Details**Known Issue: Minor bug preventing copper from spawning. Hotfix incoming soon. We've just dropped a big update for our demo in preparation for Next Fest! First thing is that we've moved off of playtest channels, and released this as an official Steam demo! This Demo will up run through the end of the Next Fest event, which ends on the 26th of October. Here's an overview list of the most impactful changes we've made for this update... Major Changes:Extend","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T17:55:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262699926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1842846814443485","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Playtest Demo Has Ended!","summary":"Hello all! Our playtest demo officially ended this week! From here we are moving the demo off of the playtest channel and over to the official demo channels in preparation for Next Fest. During this time we'll also be updating the demo with some of our most recent additions and changes. We'll be posting more news shortly with the details about the upcoming updated demo, and from there it's only a very short ways until we're releasing the game into Early Access. Can't wait to share more, and we w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T14:17:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443485","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1839676055895701","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated 75 min Playtest Demo Available!","summary":"We've Updated Our Free 75 Minute Demo!We've Updated Our Latest Demo on Steam! Players now get 75 minutes. Additionally, the timer no longer counts down during dialogue or cutscenes so there's no need to rush through those moments. This to progress through the story and quest lines as they were intended to be enjoyed, without feeling rushed. This update also includes some additional general fixes and improvements. This demo is available for free from now until the end of our Kickstarter campaign,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T19:44:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055895701","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1839041357036404","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Kickstarter Demo is now Live and Available to All!","summary":"Our Demo Is Available To Download Now!Support us on Kickstarter to get access to kickstarter deals https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/everlastundyingtale/everlast-undying-tale?ref=cjr3gpWe're super excited to announce that our demo is finally live and playable by all. This demo limits players to one hour and should give a people a good sense of what the game is like ahead of our launch in Q4 of 2026. To help open things up, here's some words from our lead game designer, Alex. \"The big day is f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-27T17:45:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357036404","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1833334318575845","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Extended to May 25th!","summary":"Hey all you Pyrrhics,The playtest has been a huge success — so we’re keeping it open one more day! Thanks to the incredible response and the number of players asking for more time, we’re extending the playtest through Monday, Memorial Day. Jump back in, bring a friend, and keep the adventure going! The playtest will close at 6PM EST MAY 25!If you want to find some people to play with or share some feedback, hop on in the Discord https://discord.gg/8FFRWDwRHappy Questing,The InSpades Team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-24T19:18:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318575845","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1832700592789563","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest 3 FAQ. We are back!","summary":"Hello future & returning Pyrrhics,Grab a friend — or meet one in our Discord — and help shape Everlast: Undying Tale from the ground up. This is your big chance to jump into Kal Crossing, immerse yourself in crafting, and just maybe leave your mark on the world.So, what’s different in this playest?Once again, hop into our worldwide servers in solo or online co-op, and help us stress-test joining — or even hosting — your own worlds. Dive into multiple questlines, try your hand at one of our 17 sk","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T15:45:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592789563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1827626365760374","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Hotfix - March 21","summary":"Hotfix Patchnotes!Our playtest has been going strong this weekend -- with many players already succeeding in breaking the game... yay? Thankfully, our devs are hard at work getting some major fixes in before the playtest ends. Look below to see what's fixed!Major Fixes and Changes* The defense skill now functions as intended.* Fixed some errors causing Single Player to not work correctly - starting a singleplayer server should now work!* Coins are no longer required for Desolate Zone upgrades.* ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-21T16:34:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365760374","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1827626365753559","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"March 19-22nd Playtest Patchnotes!","summary":"Welcome to Everlast: Undying Tale! We’ve made over one-thousand (yes, thats a 1 with 3 zeros) changes to our game since the last playtest! Our team is small but mighty, and we can’t wait to hop in and show you what’s in store. At a glance: 🧙3 new quests to complete 🏰Three dungeons to explore🔨14 skills to level🗺️9 Zones to develop into thriving areas Keep reading below to deep dive into all the new features you can expect (and how to get to them), and a list of our known issues and bugs. QuestsAs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-19T14:13:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365753559","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3818450-1826992588587248","game_id":"steam-3818450","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest #2 FAQ. Come Join Us!","summary":"Hello future Pyrrhics,Grab a friend (or meet one in our Discord) and help shape Everlast from the ground up. This is your chance to jump into co-op combat, explore Kal Crossing, and tell us what hits—and what needs work.In this playtest you’ll:Fight together in online solo or co-op and stress-test joining/hosting worldsTry early combat + gathering + crafting + questing as the foundations come onlineHelp steer development with feedback and bug reports that directly guide the next playtestEverlast","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-10T22:16:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588587248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3818450":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11